cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OrbitLab"
abstract: >-
  An offline astrodynamics and trajectory analysis console. Propagates
  orbital elements, builds Porkchop contour maps, budgets C3 and delta-v, and
  projects transfer paths in the PQW and IJK frames.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/orbitlab"
url: "https://aariv.me/orbitlab/"
keywords:
  - astrodynamics
  - orbital-mechanics
  - porkchop-plot
  - trajectory
  - delta-v
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
